#: 65ceeefb95ea4eccb9fc004f87648597
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/TG/index.rst:17
msgid "TG-12F模块，只要在天猫精灵注册相关信息就可以直接连接实现天猫精灵控制么"
msgstr ""
"Can the TG-12F module connect directly to Tmall Genie for control as long"
" as the relevant information is registered on Tmall Genie?"

#: 64476941cbbf4e3f86fd163a21746bb0
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/TG/index.rst:18
msgid "是的"
msgstr "Yes."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/TG/index.rst:21
#: c14e3c8700a6462f945b6d13cbffe977
msgid "TG-12F需要自己烧录嘛？有直接连天猫精灵的嘛？"
msgstr ""
"Does the TG-12F need to be flashed by the user? Is there one that can "
